      <Ordine>10</Ordine>
      <Capitolo>GENERAL WARNINGS</Capitolo>
      <Corpo> &lt;BR/&gt; WARNING! &lt;BR/&gt; -DEACTIVATE ALL ELECTRICALLY CONTROLLED ACCESSORIES, TAKING INTO ACCOUNT THE FOLLOWING WARNINGS: &lt;BR/&gt; MAKE SURE YOU HAVE THE CAR RADIO SECURITY CODE, IF REQUIRED, AND MAKE SURE IT IS DEACTIVATED OR RECORDED IN THE VEHICLE LOG BOOK; &lt;BR/&gt; SOME DATA (E.G. TIME DISPLAY, TEMPERATURE DISPLAY, AND THE OPERATING SETTINGS OF SOME ACCESSORIES) WILL BE RESET; &lt;BR/&gt; SOME ELECTRONIC UNITS (ENGINE ECU, BODY COMPUTER, SRS SYSTEM) REMAIN POWERED FOR A MAXIMUM OF 20 MINUTES. THEREFORE, WAIT AT LEAST 20 MINUTES AFTER PUTTING THE IGNITION SWITCH IN THE &quot;OFF&quot; POSITION BEFORE DISCONNECTING THE BATTERY; &lt;BR/&gt; DISCONNECT THE CAR BATTERY;</Corpo>
      <RifIDFileIMGANI>299010813</RifIDFileIMGANI>
      <Allineamento>D</Allineamento>
      <XFILE>
        <ID>299010813</ID>
        <Type>IMG</Type>
        <URL>GETFILE:299010813</URL>
      </XFILE>
    </XCAPITOLO>
    <XCAPITOLO>
      <RifIDDoc>199244103</RifIDDoc>
      <Ordine>20</Ordine>
      <Capitolo></Capitolo>
      <Corpo> TECHNICAL NOTE: CHECK THE POSITION OF THE AUXILIARY DRIVE BELTS BEFORE DISASSEMBLY.</Corpo>
      <RifIDFileIMGANI>299009774</RifIDFileIMGANI>
      <Allineamento>D</Allineamento>
      <XFILE>
        <ID>299009774</ID>
        <Type>IMG</Type>
        <URL>GETFILE:299009774</URL>
      </XFILE>
    </XCAPITOLO>
    <XCAPITOLO>
      <RifIDDoc>199244103</RifIDDoc>
      <Ordine>30</Ordine>
      <Capitolo></Capitolo>
      <Corpo> &lt;BR/&gt; CAUTION! &lt;BR/&gt; TO FACILITATE THE ROTATION OF THE CRANKSHAFT, IT IS RECOMMENDED TO REMOVE THE SPARK PLUGS (PETROL ENGINE) OR GLOW PLUGS (DIESEL ENGINE) FROM THE ENGINE; &lt;BR/&gt; ROTATE THE DISTRIBUTION SYSTEM BY ACTING EXCLUSIVELY ON THE CRANKSHAFT, UNLESS OTHERWISE SPECIFIED; &lt;BR/&gt; ROTATE THE DISTRIBUTION SYSTEM IN THE NORMAL DIRECTION OF ROTATION, UNLESS OTHERWISE SPECIFIED; &lt;BR/&gt; DO NOT ROTATE ANY COMPONENT OF THE DISTRIBUTION SYSTEM AFTER REMOVING THE DISTRIBUTION BELT/CHAIN, UNLESS OTHERWISE SPECIFIED; &lt;BR/&gt; DO NOT USE ALIGNMENT TOOLS TO LOCK THE ENGINE IN PLACE WHEN UNSCREWING OR TIGHTENING; &lt;BR/&gt; DO NOT PLACE ANY OBJECTS BETWEEN THE BELT AND THE PULLEYS, OR BETWEEN THE CHAIN AND THE TIMING WHEELS OF THE DISTRIBUTION SYSTEM; &lt;BR/&gt; BEFORE STARTING THE ENGINE, MANUALLY ROTATE THE ENGINE CRANKSHAFT TWO TURNS AND CHECK THAT IT IS CORRECTLY PHASED, UNLESS OTHERWISE SPECIFIED; &lt;BR/&gt; OBSERVE THE TIGHTENING TORQUES;</Corpo>
      <RifIDFileIMGANI>299010813</RifIDFileIMGANI>
      <Allineamento>D</Allineamento>
