      <Capitolo>TUNING PROCEDURE</Capitolo>
      <Corpo> &lt;BR/&gt; Disconnect the 12 V service battery. &lt;BR/&gt; Remove the front right wheel. &lt;BR/&gt; Remove the front right wheel arch. &lt;BR/&gt; Remove the engine cover. &lt;BR/&gt; Remove the service belt. &lt;BR/&gt; Turn the engine shaft until an 8 mm plug can be inserted into the hole in the flywheel.</Corpo>
      <RifIDFileIMGANI>299011896</RifIDFileIMGANI>
      <Allineamento>D</Allineamento>
      <XFILE>
